    <!-- 2D guide (tool opens in 2D) -->
    <string name="glass_guide">This is the 2D view. Tap the screen once to switch to 3D.\n\n• Hold the phone in landscape with the front camera ON THE LEFT. The other way round 3D does not work.\n• The green dot at the top left (camera in use) must be on: that is the eye tracking working.\n• Watch from 30–40 cm.\n• First time? Line up the lens with the button below (horizontal, then vertical lines). 3D locks in quickly after that.\n• In 3D, drag left/right if the picture looks doubled (phase); drag up/down if it breaks when you move your head sideways (tracking).\n• Long-press for the menu (add photos · ◀ ▶ · line-up · reset).</string>
